Subject: [PATCH ghak90 V5 06/10] audit: add support for non-syscall auxiliary records
Date:   Fri, 15 Mar 2019 14:29:54 -0400
Message-Id: <700e4313571f86cc0cdcb7310fbe060f02c7c2db.1552665316.git.rgb@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <cover.1552665316.git.rgb@redhat.com>
